// Layer_Feature_Service — Feature Service Layer (layer 4 dari 9)
// Render manual: https://app.eraser.io > Diagram-as-code (cloud architecture).
//   Buat kanvas BARU bernama "Layer_Feature_Service".
// Ekspor PNG ke materials/reports/figures/Layer_Feature_Service.png
// Acuan: subsec:lapisan-feature (Subbab IV.3, sec:arsitektur-terintegrasi); rincian
//   beralat layer baris 4 tab:layanan_industri. Disertakan sebagai fig:layer-feature.
// Fokus: Feast sebagai feature store dengan ClickHouse sebagai sumber offline,
//   Valkey sebagai online store hasil materialisasi, Qdrant sebagai indeks vektor,
//   registry berkas pada MinIO; fitur stream dari Flink mendarat langsung pada
//   Valkey dan Qdrant. Sub-sistem dual-store dirinci pada sec:feature-store-dual.
// Ikon: logo produk dari docs.eraser.io/docs/icons (diperiksa 2026-07-11): minio,
//   clickhouse, qdrant; Valkey icon generik (bukan logo Redis, beda merek fork).
// Rendering WAJIB horizontal (direction right), maksimum dua baris node per grup,
//   tanpa \rotatebox pada LaTeX.
// Landasan layer: label grup membawa kategori sumbernya (najafabadi2024analysis),
//   yaitu feature store pada storage and versioning.
// Verifikasi implementasi: model-lifecycle/feast, storage/valkey, storage/qdrant,
//   storage/clickhouse, storage/minio; fitur stream Flink -> Valkey/Qdrant.

direction right

// Sumber fitur (batas)
ClickHouse [icon: clickhouse, color: green, label: "ClickHouse (sumber offline)"]
Flink [icon: flink, color: orange, label: "Apache Flink (fitur stream)"]

// Feature Service Layer
Feature Service Layer [icon: package, color: green, label: "Feature Service Layer (feature store, storage and versioning)"] {
  Feast [icon: package, label: "Feast (feature store)"]
  Valkey [icon: zap, label: "Valkey (online store)"]
  Qdrant [icon: qdrant, label: "Qdrant (indeks vektor)"]
}

// Registry dan konsumen (batas)
MinIO [icon: minio, color: green, label: "MinIO (registry berkas Feast)"]
Model Lifecycle Layer [icon: refresh-cw, color: purple, label: "Model Lifecycle Layer (pelatihan dan inference)"]

// Alur fitur
ClickHouse > Feast: sumber offline
Feast > Valkey: materialisasi online
Feast > MinIO: registry berkas
Flink > Valkey: fitur stream
Flink > Qdrant: embedding stream
Feast > Model Lifecycle Layer: fitur pelatihan
Valkey > Model Lifecycle Layer: online feature
Qdrant > Model Lifecycle Layer: vector feature
